{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3b7d94d26fd40c78a394b9c4fa0683e62493c3013b8987b756a78b9c89cd7eaa", "ja": "（サッカーフェスで翼はゴールキーパーを任された。\n今日は一緒に練習することになったが……）", "zh": "（在足球节上，翼被安排担任守门员。\n今天本来说好要一起练习，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "94c2f82d9a5dcb4a51c520d967b9796f424f14d7cb85d0e5f1765ffcd1bba7c3", "ja": "う～ん……こっちとあっちなら、あっちかな～。\nううっ、でもでも……。", "zh": "嗯……这边和那边比起来，还是那边吧～  \n呜呜，可是可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c8eebf3c67687ab9e25036c153a48c6ce2c624a360c500eaf7928888b6f5eaae", "ja": "お待たせ、翼。何か考え事か？", "zh": "让你久等了，翼。是在想什么事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5eb2ae970959892bf719bcd3d1671023aabbf44a3ce5488e20cd8121597be5a3", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。お疲れさまです♪\n考え事っていうか……研究？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。辛苦了♪  \n与其说是在想事情……算是研究？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b2f2528d193b58bbe759b745924683691133d87f9a170575add0d8b8779396ac", "ja": "わたし、キーパーじゃないですか。走らないのは\n楽だけど、全然目立てないんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "我可是守门员嘛。不跑动虽然轻松，但这样一来完全没法引人注目吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "73f7bc6c4f9b69934521bd4497a0e93c59dfd9be0c31a8c2627a0e37cb387c28", "ja": "試合で目立つなら、みんなの注目を集めるプレー\nじゃないと。だから動画を見て、研究してたんでーす！", "zh": "要在比赛里出风头，就得做出能吸引所有人目光的动作才行。\n所以我一直在看视频研究呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ffd5715b274fdd165e10f9955ef54b7549cd6006d0f6e68f3c251c20c88b6bb5", "ja": "なるほどな。研究までして、えらいな翼！\nそれで、どんな動画を見てたんだ？", "zh": "原来如此。居然还专门研究了，真了不起，翼！  \n那么，你看的是哪种视频？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1376c0956cf8f4e495cd6907c96e2b3666dcfda2c65a83605cd54398c80c8502", "ja": "えっと、スーパープレイ動画ってやつですよ♪\nゴールを絶対に守るぞーって感じでカッコいいんです！", "zh": "那个……就是所谓的精彩操作视频哦♪\n那种“绝对要守住球门！”的感觉，特别帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1b3143bc377d674ea361a98ddc7db730fa226b7d328bae06e8aa2089afcd5b7c", "ja": "たしかに。鉄壁のディフェンスができたら、\n目立つ可能性も上がるけど……難しいんじゃないのか？", "zh": "确实。要是能打出铜墙铁壁般的防守，\n出风头的可能性也会增加，不过……应该没那么容易吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dc2b2fee9a37a66ec8f33cdec4da0a315ee48177ba868af099ca4828f9ce27e9", "ja": "そうですか？　プレーならすぐできると思いますよ。\n何となく、イメージも湧いてるし！", "zh": "是吗？要说比赛发挥的话，我觉得马上就能做到。总觉得已经有点想象出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1010_p", "source_sha256": "23fe0f851c27dbc7b3ac6649b37fdec12e65ee0bac955ff1785f563e89618e33", "ja": "そ、そうか。動画をみただけで……。\nまず一度それを試してみて、練習メニューを決めよう。", "zh": "这、这样啊。光看了视频就……  \n先试一次，再决定练习菜单吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1a5c5eb0e1f2f4e3a0ab4515524b5af254e3b4f8bb314900ecd082b63b91f6a0", "ja": "はーい！　それじゃ{$P$}さん、\nいつでもいいですよー！", "zh": "好——！那么{$P$}先生，随时都可以哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "feb77c619fcf8c76a05de966daff44f9ad8acf2efc6a88bf017b953de728fde6", "ja": "えっ？　じゃなくて！　シュートしてくれないと、\nわたしの練習にならないじゃないですかー！", "zh": "不是“诶？”！你不投篮的话，我不就没法练习了吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f6cbca8581294ad0492c5986a5b81e192d72e43dfb35cf93477ed8b846e9a656", "ja": "あ、ああ。そうだな。\nそれじゃ、行くぞー！　それっ！", "zh": "啊、啊。也是。\n那就上了——！嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1015_null", "source_sha256": "073a864edea79495fdf27e7dff9c23e8b0733c33408703108470d81dd1e9be5f", "ja": "ボコッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1fa84bc091dbfd97e65f93f6e49e31cfc1459704c7a4b0a886e8d26ed13777f3", "ja": "キャーッチ！　うーん……なんか簡単……。\n{$P$}さん、手加減してません？", "zh": "接住！　嗯……总觉得好简单……。\n{$P$}先生，你没手下留情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "017f07a14a43f24954da3d7d11c80bd689fbbb0b6b0dd08365cb0e7c8fac37b7", "ja": "わたしがモテモテになるための練習なんだから、\n本気でやってくださいね。もう一回、お願いしまーす♪", "zh": "这可是为了让我大受欢迎才做的练习，\n请认真一点来嘛。再来一次，拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0393_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c2739fb477b419065684ce8aecf6ebc174884d168a31d6a6d33c8923f17e79fb", "ja": "（翼はすぐにカッコいいセービングをマスターした。\n久々の運動は楽しかったが……明日は筋肉痛だな）", "zh": "（翼很快就掌握了帅气的扑救动作。\n久违的运动很开心，不过……明天肯定会肌肉酸痛吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
